{"attachment_metadata":[],"author_person_id":"merlini-2","author_source_handle":"@GobRoss","content_sha256":"2252dccd7c903a58205b63e485c13d7302b19f186d71fb73db7268f0425aacbf","created_at":"2026-09-01T11:39:57Z","english_summary":null,"ingested_at":"2026-09-01T11:39:58.438810Z","record_id":"tg:tawg:3904","relations":[{"relation_type":"reply_to","target_record_id":"tg:tawg:16"}],"schema_version":"tawg.source-record.v1","source_locator":"repo:data/telegram/2026/09/messages.jsonl#tg:tawg:3904","source_payload":{"author_is_bot":false,"edited":false,"message_kind":"group_message","message_thread_id":16,"update_id":998811170},"source_type":"telegram_message","text_original":"Deployed. ccip-router-production is now running 6bd66611 — /health reports 0.8.0 (the legible\nproof the old stale 0.7.0 build is gone). TSEI Profile A ingest is live and fail-closed:\n\nPOST /tsei/profile-a/observations unauth → 401 (Bearer required), wrong secret → 401 — the\nTSEI_PROFILE_A_INGEST_SECRET is set (fresh, ≥32, distinct from ADMIN_SECRET).\nGET /tsei/profile-a/observations/:inputHash is the read route; bare GET …/observations 404s (never a\nroute — it’s POST-only ingest), so ignore that one.\nIngest secret is in Railway only — I’ll hand it to you over a private channel when you’re ready to submit the\nproduction TSEI receipt (not here). Smoke-test away and ping me if anything’s off.\n\nOne heads-up: this was the auto-deploy-hook gap biting again — the be2fd43f/6bd66611 merges didn’t ship\non their own. I deployed via the CLI from source. Future merges: I can re-run the from-source redeploy from\nhere on demand, or we enable the deploy-on-push trigger in the Railway service settings once — your call.","updated_at":"2026-09-01T11:39:57Z"}
